  "prefLabel": "Res 5302.11 Determination of Market Value",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 5302.11 Determination of Market Value. Market value shall be determined by one of the following:\n\n(a) An assessing official;\n\n(b) A licensed professional forester; or\n\n(c) The director or the director’s authorized agent.\n\nSource. #10547, eff 3-21-14",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/res5200-5900.html"
